{"seq":1,"slug":"fsm-design-patterns","title":"有限状态机设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/fundamentals/fsm-design-patterns","wordCount":1217,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"有限状态机设计模式\">有限状态机设计模式</h1><p>有限状态机（Finite State Machine，FSM）是游戏开发中最经典的行为管理工具。从街机游戏时代的敌人 AI 到现代 3A 游戏的角色控制器，FSM 凭借其清晰的结构和可预测的行为，持续活跃在游戏逻辑的核心地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有限状态机由三个核心元素构成：状态（State）定义对象所处的模式，转换（Transition）描述状态切换的条件，动作（Action）是进入/退出/处于状态时执行的逻辑。FSM 保证同一时刻只有一个状态激活，消除了复杂条件分支中「隐式状态」带来的混乱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fsm-的三元组核心\">FSM 的三元组核心</h2><p>FSM 的本质可以用三个要素完整描述：<strong>状态（State）、转换（Transition）、动作（Action）</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>状态</strong>定义了系统在某一时刻的模式。每个状态是互斥的——同一时刻只有一个状态处于激活状态。状态不存储数据，只定义行为。</p>\n<p><strong>转换</strong>描述了从一个状态到另一个状态的条件。转换由<strong>触发条件</strong>驱动，条件可以是布尔判断（速度 &gt; 0）、事件（收到攻击消息）或定时器（停留超过 3 秒）。</p>\n<p><strong>动作</strong>分为三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作类型</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OnEnter</td>\n<td>进入状态的第一帧</td>\n<td>播放进入动画、初始化计时器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OnUpdate</td>\n<td>状态激活期间每帧</td>\n<td>执行持续逻辑、检查转换条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OnExit</td>\n<td>离开状态的最后一帧</td>\n<td>清理资源、取消预约事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Idle&#10;    Idle --&gt; Walking: 速度 &gt; 0&#10;    Walking --&gt; Idle: 速度 == 0&#10;    Walking --&gt; Running: 按下冲刺键&#10;    Running --&gt; Walking: 松开冲刺键&#10;    Idle --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键&#10;    Walking --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键&#10;    Running --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键&#10;    Jumping --&gt; Idle: 落地检测\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Idle\n    Idle --&gt; Walking: 速度 &gt; 0\n    Walking --&gt; Idle: 速度 == 0\n    Walking --&gt; Running: 按下冲刺键\n    Running --&gt; Walking: 松开冲刺键\n    Idle --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键\n    Walking --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键\n    Running --&gt; Jumping: 按下跳跃键\n    Jumping --&gt; Idle: 落地检测</pre><h2 id=\"枚举模式与对象模式\">枚举模式与对象模式</h2><p>实现 FSM 有两种主流方式，选择依据是状态的数量和复杂程度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"枚举模式\">枚举模式</h3><p>用枚举值表示状态，配合 switch-case 处理逻辑。适用于状态简单、逻辑短小的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public enum PlayerState&#10;{&#10;    Idle,&#10;    Walking,&#10;    Running,&#10;    Jumping,&#10;    Falling,&#10;    Dead&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class PlayerController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private PlayerState currentState = PlayerState.Idle;&#10;    private PlayerState previousState;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        previousState = currentState;&#10;        UpdateState();&#10;&#10;        if (previousState != currentState)&#10;        {&#10;            OnExitState(previousState);&#10;            OnEnterState(currentState);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        ExecuteState(currentState);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void UpdateState()&#10;    {&#10;        switch (currentState)&#10;        {&#10;            case PlayerState.Idle:&#10;                if (GetInputAxis() != Vector2.zero)&#10;                    currentState = PlayerState.Walking;&#10;                if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;                    currentState = PlayerState.Jumping;&#10;                break;&#10;&#10;            case PlayerState.Walking:&#10;                if (GetInputAxis() == Vector2.zero)&#10;                    currentState = PlayerState.Idle;&#10;                if (Input.GetButton(&quot;Sprint&quot;))&#10;                    currentState = PlayerState.Running;&#10;                if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;                    currentState = PlayerState.Jumping;&#10;                break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnterState(PlayerState state)&#10;    {&#10;        switch (state)&#10;        {&#10;            case PlayerState.Jumping:&#10;                ApplyJumpForce();&#10;                PlayAnimation(&quot;Jump_Start&quot;);&#10;                break;&#10;            case PlayerState.Dead:&#10;                DisableInput();&#10;                PlayDeathEffect();&#10;                break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnExitState(PlayerState state)&#10;    {&#10;        switch (state)&#10;        {&#10;            case PlayerState.Jumping:&#10;                ResetJumpCounter();&#10;                break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public enum PlayerState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Idle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Walking,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Running,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Jumping,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Falling,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Dead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PlayerController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private PlayerState currentState = PlayerState.Idle;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private PlayerState previousState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        previousState = currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UpdateState();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (previousState != currentState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            OnExitState(previousState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            OnEnterState(currentState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExecuteState(currentState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void UpdateState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (currentState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case PlayerState.Idle:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (GetInputAxis() != Vector2.zero)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentState = PlayerState.Walking;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentState = PlayerState.Jumping;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case PlayerState.Walking:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (GetInputAxis() == Vector2.zero)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentState = PlayerState.Idle;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (Input.GetButton(\"Sprint\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentState = PlayerState.Running;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentState = PlayerState.Jumping;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnterState(PlayerState state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case PlayerState.Jumping:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ApplyJumpForce();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PlayAnimation(\"Jump_Start\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case PlayerState.Dead:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                DisableInput();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PlayDeathEffect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnExitState(PlayerState state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case PlayerState.Jumping:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ResetJumpCounter();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>枚举模式的优点是代码直白、性能好（无虚函数调用），缺点是状态增多后 switch-case 膨胀难以维护，OnEnter/OnExit/OnUpdate 分散在不同位置导致状态逻辑碎片化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对象模式-state-pattern\">对象模式（State Pattern）</h3><p>将每个状态封装为独立类，状态的逻辑内聚在类内部。适用于状态复杂、每个状态有大量独立逻辑的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 状态基类&#10;public abstract class PlayerStateBase&#10;{&#10;    protected PlayerController owner;&#10;&#10;    public PlayerStateBase(PlayerController controller)&#10;    {&#10;        owner = controller;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public virtual void OnEnter() { }&#10;    public virtual void OnUpdate() { }&#10;    public virtual void OnFixedUpdate() { }&#10;    public virtual void OnExit() { }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 空闲状态&#10;public class IdleState : PlayerStateBase&#10;{&#10;    public IdleState(PlayerController controller) : base(controller) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter()&#10;    {&#10;        owner.Animator.SetBool(&quot;IsMoving&quot;, false);&#10;        owner.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(0, owner.Rigidbody.velocity.y, 0);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        if (owner.InputHandler.MoveInput.magnitude &gt; 0.1f)&#10;            owner.StateMachine.ChangeState&lt;WalkState&gt;();&#10;&#10;        if (owner.InputHandler.JumpPressed)&#10;            owner.StateMachine.ChangeState&lt;JumpState&gt;();&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 状态机管理器&#10;public class StateMachine&#10;{&#10;    private PlayerStateBase currentState;&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;Type, PlayerStateBase&gt; stateInstances;&#10;&#10;    public void Initialize(PlayerController controller)&#10;    {&#10;        stateInstances = new Dictionary&lt;Type, PlayerStateBase&gt;&#10;        {&#10;            { typeof(IdleState), new IdleState(controller) },&#10;            { typeof(WalkState), new WalkState(controller) },&#10;            { typeof(JumpState), new JumpState(controller) }&#10;        };&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ChangeState&lt;T&gt;() where T : PlayerStateBase&#10;    {&#10;        currentState?.OnExit();&#10;        currentState = stateInstances[typeof(T)];&#10;        currentState.OnEnter();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Update() =&gt; currentState?.OnUpdate();&#10;    public void FixedUpdate() =&gt; currentState?.OnFixedUpdate();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态基类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    protected PlayerController owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public PlayerStateBase(PlayerController controller)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner = controller;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnEnter() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnUpdate() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnFixedUpdate() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnExit() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 空闲状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class IdleState : PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IdleState(PlayerController controller) : base(controller) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner.Animator.SetBool(\"IsMoving\", false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(0, owner.Rigidbody.velocity.y, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (owner.InputHandler.MoveInput.magnitude > 0.1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            owner.StateMachine.ChangeState&#x3C;WalkState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (owner.InputHandler.JumpPressed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            owner.StateMachine.ChangeState&#x3C;JumpState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态机管理器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateMachine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private PlayerStateBase currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;Type, PlayerStateBase> stateInstances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Initialize(PlayerController controller)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stateInstances = new Dictionary&#x3C;Type, PlayerStateBase></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            { typeof(IdleState), new IdleState(controller) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            { typeof(WalkState), new WalkState(controller) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            { typeof(JumpState), new JumpState(controller) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ChangeState&#x3C;T>() where T : PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState?.OnExit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = stateInstances[typeof(T)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Update() => currentState?.OnUpdate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void FixedUpdate() => currentState?.OnFixedUpdate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对象模式让每个状态的逻辑高度内聚，新增状态只需新建一个类，符合开放-封闭原则。代价是多了一层类层次，以及虚函数调用的微小性能开销（在状态机规模内通常可忽略）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转换条件的设计原则\">转换条件的设计原则</h2><p>转换条件是 FSM 最容易写错的部分，几个关键原则：</p>\n<p><strong>条件要幂等</strong>：同一帧内多次检查同一条件，结果应该相同。避免在条件检查中修改状态（副作用）。</p>\n<p><strong>避免转换循环</strong>：A → B → A 的快速循环会导致每帧触发两次 OnEnter/OnExit，消耗性能并产生视觉抖动。加入最小停留时间或优先级可以缓解。</p>\n<p><strong>明确转换优先级</strong>：当多个转换条件同时满足时，要有确定的优先级规则。通常死亡 &gt; 被击中 &gt; 主动行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 带优先级的转换检查&#10;private void CheckTransitions()&#10;{&#10;    // 优先级从高到低&#10;    if (healthSystem.IsDead)&#10;    {&#10;        ChangeState(PlayerState.Dead);&#10;        return; // early return，高优先级拦截&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (isHit &amp;&amp; hitStunDuration &gt; 0)&#10;    {&#10;        ChangeState(PlayerState.HitStun);&#10;        return;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 普通行为转换&#10;    if (isGrounded)&#10;    {&#10;        if (inputMagnitude &gt; 0.1f)&#10;            ChangeState(PlayerState.Walking);&#10;        else&#10;            ChangeState(PlayerState.Idle);&#10;    }&#10;    else&#10;    {&#10;        if (rigidbody.velocity.y &lt; -0.1f)&#10;            ChangeState(PlayerState.Falling);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 带优先级的转换检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>private void CheckTransitions()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 优先级从高到低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (healthSystem.IsDead)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ChangeState(PlayerState.Dead);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return; // early return，高优先级拦截</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (isHit &#x26;&#x26; hitStunDuration > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ChangeState(PlayerState.HitStun);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 普通行为转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (isGrounded)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (inputMagnitude > 0.1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ChangeState(PlayerState.Walking);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ChangeState(PlayerState.Idle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (rigidbody.velocity.y &#x3C; -0.1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ChangeState(PlayerState.Falling);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱与调试技巧\">常见陷阱与调试技巧</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：在 OnExit 中修改了会影响 OnEnter 的数据</strong>。OnExit 和 OnEnter 在同一帧调用，若 OnExit 重置了某个标志位，而新状态的 OnEnter 依赖这个标志位，会出现顺序问题。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：遗漏边缘状态</strong>。「死亡时正在跳跃」、「攻击时被击倒」等组合情况容易遗漏。建议用状态转换表穷举所有合法/非法转换。</p>\n<p><strong>调试方法</strong>：记录状态转换历史，在开发阶段打印状态变化日志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public void ChangeState(PlayerState newState)&#10;{&#10;    Debug.Log($&quot;[FSM] {Time.time:F2} {currentState} -&gt; {newState}&quot;);&#10;    previousState = currentState;&#10;    currentState = newState;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public void ChangeState(PlayerState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Debug.Log($\"[FSM] {Time.time:F2} {currentState} -> {newState}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    previousState = currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    currentState = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态机的适用边界\">状态机的适用边界</h2><p>FSM 在以下情况下开始力不从心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态数量超过 10-15 个，且有大量类似的转换逻辑</li>\n<li>需要「记住上一个状态」并恢复（→ 考虑下推自动机）</li>\n<li>多个独立的状态维度需要同时处于不同状态（→ 考虑并发状态机）</li>\n<li>某些状态包含嵌套的子状态逻辑（→ 考虑层次状态机）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FSM 最适合状态数量可控（5-10 个）、转换条件清晰、不需要状态记忆的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>FSM 的价值在于它把「对象在做什么」变成了明确的、可枚举的离散状态，消除了复杂 if-else 链中隐含的状态混乱。枚举模式适合快速原型和简单状态机，对象模式（State Pattern）适合复杂、可扩展的实现。转换条件的设计要注意优先级、幂等性和循环问题。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"hierarchical-state-machines\">层次状态机</a> — 当状态数量增长，需要嵌套子状态时的解决方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"state-machine-implementation\">状态机实现策略</a> — 对比四种实现方式的适用场景与性能特征</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有限状态机设计模式","id":"有限状态机设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FSM 的三元组核心","id":"fsm-的三元组核心"},{"level":2,"text":"枚举模式与对象模式","id":"枚举模式与对象模式"},{"level":3,"text":"枚举模式","id":"枚举模式"},{"level":3,"text":"对象模式（State Pattern）","id":"对象模式-state-pattern"},{"level":2,"text":"转换条件的设计原则","id":"转换条件的设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与调试技巧","id":"常见陷阱与调试技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机的适用边界","id":"状态机的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"层次状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/fundamentals/hierarchical-state-machines"}}